WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:18.219
The release of Dark souls in 2011 came with an intriguing comment by the game's director Hidetaka Miyazaki.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:26.320
He suggested that the player should choose either the pendant or nothing as a starting gift to enhance their experience. And

00:00:27.289 --> 00:00:34.718
so, a crusade started: a mission undertaken by the game's most devoted players. A quest to find out what the pendant did.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:44.079
It's been almost a year now and nothing has been found. Players, myself included, have been starting with the pendant dropping it in certain places,

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:49.929
hitting every wall with it in our possession trying to discover the cryptic meaning of the pendant.

00:00:55.579 --> 00:00:57.200
Surely it's something incredible.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:02.950
There's probably an amazing truth to the pendant because the secret is hidden so well. That's why it's hidden

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:07.419
so well. The person who finds the meaning will be a hero in the dark souls community.

00:01:08.659 --> 00:01:15.159
So let's take a look at the clues. The description of the pendant states that it's fond mem- wait. What's this?

00:01:16.429 --> 00:01:22.329
"When it comes to the pendant I actually had a little bit of an intention to play a prank."

00:01:23.509 --> 00:01:25.509
Prank.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.520
A prank!

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:42.380
No, God, no god please no no no noooooooooooo

